              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BonBon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We use to make these all the time. When I saw \"Pink Lady\", I couldn't believe my eyes. We always made these using ice cream. Use the grenadine syrup and the gin. Put it into blender and you will the best of the best. I love eating the first of it with a spoon!"
